CLAUDE.md

# Agent skill packs. These are vendored third-party tooling, not app source.
# `.agents` duplicates `.claude/skills` exactly, and its ~64 bundled .mjs/.js
# helper scripts were counting as first-party code in GitHub's language stats.
.claude
.agents 